  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response Package for El Nino, slow onset and climate disasters (Pacific and Timor-Leste)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is an emergency response package prepared in response to El Nino, slow onset and climate related disasters in the Pacific and Timor-Leste for financial years 2023-24 to 2025-2026. This flexible fund provides demand-driven support to NGOs and Red Cross National Societies.</narrative>
